OL,3,AShetland spaceport project secures #30m
OL,4,Aof UK government investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government has announced
OL,7,Finvestment of #30m in SaxaVord
OL,8,FSpaceport in Shetland as part of a new
OL,9,Fnational space strategy.
OL,11,FA spaceport spokesperson said the
OL,12,Ffunding was a "hugely significant" vote
OL,13,Fof confidence and would unlock a
OL,14,Ffurther #30m of private investment.
OL,16,FSeveral companies hope to use SaxaVord
OL,17,Fin Unst, the northernmost point in the
OL,18,FUK, as a launch site for small
OL,19,Fcommercial rockets.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
